[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 STR (Software Test Report)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Strategy
STATEMENT: The system shall undergo comprehensive testing including unit, integration, system, and acceptance testing.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Environment
STATEMENT: The system shall be tested in environments that simulate production conditions.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Coverage
STATEMENT: The system shall achieve minimum 90% code coverage and 100% requirement coverage.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STR-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Automation
STATEMENT: The system shall support automated testing with continuous integration and deployment.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.